<title>USA: Hilb, Rogal says Andrew Rogal new CEO.</title>
<headline>Hilb, Rogal says Andrew Rogal new CEO.</headline>
<dateline>RICHMOND, Va. 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hilb, Rogal and Hamilton Co said Tuesday Andrew Rogal has been elected chief executive and will continue as president.</p>
<p>The company said Robert Hilb retired as chief executive, but will continue as chairman.</p>
<p>The company said Rogal has been president and chief operating officer since February 1995 and a director since 1989.  A company spokeswoman said they have no new chief operating officer at this point.</p>
</text>
